{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "70054aaa-09cf-8f3c-a51c-16ce6f0764bc",
  "created_at": "2026-03-02T11:34:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Thomas Sisson",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:33:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:33:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, hi. Yeah, I'm trying to reach the school department. Is this the school department?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:33:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, sir, this is the City Clerk at Newport City Hall. I think you may have the wrong number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:33:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Huh. Well, I dialed the number off the back of my kid's, my nephew's, folder. Is this not a four-oh-one? I thought they were all four-oh-one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:33:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, four-oh-one is the area code for all of Rhode Island. So that part's right. It's the seven digits after it that must be off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:33:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. So the area code's fine. I thought maybe I needed a different one, like for Middletown. Oh, and by the way, I'm parked down by the harbor right now and the water looks totally flat. Not a ripple. Anyway, the school department."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:33:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Take your time. I'd suggest looking up Newport Public Schools on the city website or checking the folder again for the main office number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:33:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I just try the folder again, with the four-oh-one first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:33:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Four-oh-one, then the seven digits. Hopefully that gets you there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:33:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks, Owen. Sorry about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:34:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble at all. Have a good day."
    }
  ],
